      "text": "These two services can't finish starting."
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "start": 2.141875,
      "end": 5.667917,
      "text": "Spring starts Service A, whose constructor needs Service B."
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "start": 5.747917,
      "end": 12.84,
      "text": "But Service B needs Service A first. The arguments must exist before construction. Neither constructor can finish."
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "start": 12.92,
      "end": 18.568333,
      "text": "Startup fails with a bean currently in creation exception. This is a constructor cycle."
