      "scene": 5,
      "start": 18.648333,
      "end": 25.056667,
      "text": "Refactor the collaboration. An orchestration service calls A and B; they no longer depend on each other."
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "start": 25.136667,
      "end": 34.350208,
      "text": "Our tests confirm failure before, and successful startup after. Other circular references behave differently. Redesign the dependency graph."
    },
